# ResearchX monorepo — environment overview

Copy per-app examples:

- `apps/ai-service/.env.example` → `apps/ai-service/.env`
- `apps/server/.env.example` → `apps/server/.env`
- `apps/web/.env.example` → `apps/web/.env`

Never put secrets in `apps/web/.env` except public `VITE_*` values.

---

# AI service (mirror of apps/ai-service/.env.example)

LLM_PROVIDER=groq
LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b
GROQ_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY_2=
GROQ_API_KEY_3=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
SEARCH_PROVIDER=tavily
SEARCH_FALLBACK=serper
TAVILY_API_KEY=
SERPER_API_KEY=
MAX_SOURCES=20
CHROMA_PATH=./data/chroma
CACHE_PATH=./data/cache
OUTPUT_PATH=./data/outputs
DOCUMENTS_PATH=./data/documents
API_HOST=127.0.0.1
API_PORT=8000
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000,http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
MOCK_MODE=false
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
